# Audit AI and Graph\-RAG Pipelines

`audit-ai-or-graph-rag` · learning path

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Audience | Developers recording extracted facts, chunks, and tools\. |

## Goal

Connect generated claims to source chunks, evidence spans, tools, model context, and provenance before consumers see them\.

## Quickstart

```turtle
# gmeow:Chunk
<subject> a gmeow:Chunk ;
    gmeow:chunkOf <...> .  # gmeow:InformationObject

# gmeow:Dataset
<subject> a gmeow:Dataset ;
    gmeow:citeAs "..." ;  # rdfs:Literal
    gmeow:version "..." .  # xsd:string

# gmeow:EvidenceSpan
<subject> a gmeow:EvidenceSpan ;
    gmeow:spanOfChunk <...> ;  # gmeow:Chunk
    gmeow:supportPolarity <...> .  # gmeow:SupportPolarity

# gmeow:ExtractedEntity
<subject> a gmeow:ExtractedEntity .

# gmeow:usedModel
<subject> a gmeow:ModelInvocation ;
    gmeow:usedModel <...> .  # gmeow:SoftwareAgent
```

